= A Hole in the Archives

[? if quigon_alive : Qui-Gon Jinn has been hunting the Sith Master for years. Now he brings the Caucus a strange discovery. ?][? if not quigon_alive : A Jedi archivist, troubled, confides in the Caucus. ?] Somewhere beyond the Outer Rim, near the Rishi Maze, gravity charts show a star system with no planet listed. Someone has deleted it from the Jedi Archives. The last Jedi to access those records was Master **Sifo-Dyas**, who died, conveniently, shortly before the Naboo crisis.

*Shadow Investigations can now pursue the missing system.*

- @ok: Note it.

@ok

The Caucus quietly adds the missing system to its list of questions.
